    "description": "Small and peaceful campsite located right by Öresund. Here you can enjoy a beautiful sandy beach, bathing dock and fantastic sunset views.",
    "fullDescription": "At Barsebäckstrands Camping, the sea is your nearest neighbor and all pitches enjoy a beautiful sea view with a pathway down to the white shallow beach or perhaps a dip from the dock.<br /> Here you have access to two service buildings to make your camping experience more comfortable. The older service building has hostel rooms, kitchen, shower and toilets. The newer service building is a pavilion with toilets and separate shower rooms.",
